{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:df0a16e699f663a50f4d5e6e6c713d6911bfea4a70e5711b2f9bd0d76c314920",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b18e93ad97a9c5d55779ad8f715e702a545671d6ccc509bfe3e045555be8414",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦～。\n刚才谢谢你帮我把落下的东西送过来～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e61cf74ff0bd720a56aa0059761b868539318a5b10ce7de0eb1f62d3576ddfcf",
      "text": "里面装着\n什么东西呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5949a25a659623a40d750df922b96dd65d352f671eec72d6e4f60df84144ee55",
      "text": "是玩偶哦～。是拍摄时用到的\n道具复制品～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2281d64a7f35a919ca4075962e37e41ecb08d2839d55cfb4c94c68b0762c189d",
      "text": "好像是工作人员出于个人爱好做出来的～。对方说我可以拿走，我就带回来了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:421e5d0b2d4b8299f60288afb40be400f0c5c5c868711280392d25b9b56b54d1",
      "text": "因为那是犯人的随身物品，按理说本来不算什么吉利的东西才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:510d0d8d05595e30bedc4b14fc3e36a6fa8bade8758a48e2c7b4438f35409990",
      "text": "可是它的长相挺让人上瘾的，我也有用到它的镜头，不知不觉就产生感情了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7a156bd9c94a09d79718dee81e864182ed8dfac00aaaaebc533459d58979d60",
      "text": "以前在杂货铺打工的时候，也经常能见到喜欢这种设计的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:568de49d8dda7aaa05c3eac4681299de0eaff53e0b5ce74be04fdd67cf86845b",
      "text": "……啊，说不定它会火起来，\n然后被做成周边商品之类的呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ccff86d80e5e30eeb7e7227c1143f1eb6d49841e23042c3478aab42a84f21a",
      "text": "要是真出了周边，我一定会送给制作人一个的～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_b:2_4_045_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a2463156d2a510514fdfb15c5a67876a5e7257e75f111f473c2811d6713050",
      "text": "啊，电车好像快要进站了～。\n那就明天见啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
